     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>We are setting up a global R-Ladies remote group for R-ladies who do not live near a physical chapter or cannot get to meetings for family reasons.</div><div><br></div><div>Details can be found in this tweet: </div><div><br></div><span style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-decoration-line:underline\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://twitter.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496515418000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0a8sRVRBuFTomhrp1yziBo\">https://twitter.com/</a></span><span style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-decoration-line:underline\">RLadiesRemote/status/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-decoration-line:underline\">963150549301346305</span><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>We are currently collecting interest to launch in a few months, so please fill in the form in the twitter post or here: <span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://goo.gl/BoLrVz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/BoLrVz&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496515418000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3oF9iH0YtSNK8Lc7B5vgOc\">https://goo.gl/BoLrVz</a> and share with anyone you know who might be interested. R-Ladies remote will be a global community for R-ladies from zero R experience to  experienced practitioners.</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Thanks</span></div></div>"
